<measure n="33" right="end"><staff n="1"><layer n="1"><note xml:id="n63" dur="2" dots="1" pname="a" oct="4"/><rest xml:id="p33_1" dur="4"/></layer></staff></measure>
</section>
</score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Lord I open now.</l><l>I just received Your life;</l><l>Your joy now fills my heart,</l><l>Your peace has freed my soul.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Dear Lord, You&#x27;ve won our hearts.</l><l>We now surrender all;</l><l>Our life belongs to You,</l><l>Dear Jesus, seek us close.</l></lg>
<lg label="Chorus"><l>Oh Lord, since Your blood</l><l>Has set us free,</l><l>We will live for eternity.</l><l>So lost in Your love;</l><l>So close to Your heart,</l><l>Dear Lord, ever draw us near.</l></lg>
</div>
</back></music></mei>